		© {year} Lautaro Vera. Code <a href="https://github.com/lautarovera/lautarovera.github.io/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT</a>,
		content <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.
		<a href="https://github.com/lautarovera/lautarovera.github.io">Source</a>.
	</p>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
		padding: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-5);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	p {
		margin: 0;
	}
	a {
		color: inherit;
	}
</style>
